---
source: crates/fcli/src/cmd/mirror.rs
expression: out
---
them/proj

pull mirror  none
  Forgejo can only make a repository a pull mirror when it is created:
  `fcli repo create <name> --mirror-from <url>`.

push mirrors  2 (force push)

  remote_mirror_abc123
    to        https://github.com/me/proj.git
    branches  (all, --mirror)
    interval  8h0m0s
    on commit yes
    last sync -

  remote_mirror_def456
    to        https://codeberg.org/me/proj.git
    branches  main, release/*
    interval  10m0s
    on commit no
    last sync -
    error     authentication required
